FinalExplanation: The function `read_filesystem_tables_4()` is vulnerable to unchecked errors from the read operations. This can lead to data corruption or unexpected behavior if any of the read operations fail. To mitigate this vulnerability, each read operation should be checked for success before proceeding with the next operation.

